\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 HLS Hue Circle with True Complements
\f1\b0\fs24 \
\
The HLS (Hue, Lightness, Saturation) color model represents colors in a cylindrical coordinate system. Unlike RGB which is based on additive color mixing, HLS is designed to be more intuitive for humans to understand and work with.\
\
\
